# Stranglethorn Vale - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 confirmed flagged rares of Stranglethorn
# Vale and its fixed world containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at
# the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare
# that is not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items
# whose SOLE dropper is the rare, and two of the eight have none - they
# ship as kill goals with notes. Four rares are a single confirmed point
# each (plain single-goto steps - a loop needs at least two); four loop
# their 2-6 confirmed points. No tame lines ship (the data has no
# tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or
# objective of any core-contracted quest (the 1678/1680 ID collision was
# checked and cleared - see docs/stranglethorn-companions-inventory.md).
# Booty Bay sits on this map and counts as zone content.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-rares
title Stranglethorn Vale - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-45
zone Stranglethorn Vale
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords stranglethorn, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Gluggle — the north-west

  zone map 1434

  loop
  goto 33.92,22.63
  goto 34.71,21.90
  goto 34.87,22.71
  goto 35.52,23.73
  kill 14487 optional
  collect 281750 "Murloc Oracle's Dagger" optional
  note Level 37 rare looping four confirmed points in the north-west; its sole drop is the Murloc Oracle's Dagger. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Roloch — the north

  zone map 1434

  goto 37.37,31.22
  kill 14488 optional
  note Level 38 rare at its single confirmed point in the north; the data shows no sole drop for it, so there is nothing to collect. No quest takes it.
  note Drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

